4 18:15:00', 'title': 'ROSEN, NATIONAL TRIAL COUNSEL, ENCOURAGES WELLS FARGO & COMPANY INVESTORS WITH LOSSES IN EXCESS OF $100K TO SECURE COUNSEL BEFORE IMPORTANT DEADLINE IN SECURITIES CLASS ACTION - WFC', 'text': 'NEW YORK, NEW YORK--(NEWSFILE CORP. - JULY 4, 2022) - WHY: ROSEN LAW FIRM, A GLOBAL INVESTOR RIGHTS LAW FIRM, ANNOUNCES THE FILING OF A CLASS ACTION LAWSUIT ON BEHALF OF PURCHASERS OF THE SECURITIES OF WELLS FARGO & COMPANY (NYSE: WFC) BETWEEN FEBRUARY 24, 2021 AND JUNE 9, 2022, BOTH DATES INCLUSIVE (THE "CLASS PERIOD"). IF YOU WISH TO SERVE AS LEAD PLAINTIFF, YOU MUST MOVE THE COURT NO LATER THAN AUGUST 29, 2022.SO...'}